WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.370 --> 00:00:03.318
展开 Application / Expand Application

2
00:00:03.318 --> 00:00:06.320
选择本次 Unknown 归属 / Select this run’s Unknown attribution

3
00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:09.318
展开 Host / Expand Host

4
00:00:09.318 --> 00:00:12.372
选择 127.0.0.1 / Select 127.0.0.1

5
00:00:12.372 --> 00:00:15.372
展开 Protocol / Expand Protocol

6
00:00:15.372 --> 00:00:18.369
选择 HTTP/1.1 / Select HTTP/1.1

7
00:00:18.369 --> 00:00:21.370
展开 Content type / Expand Content type

8
00:00:21.370 --> 00:00:24.373
选择 json，剩一条请求 / Select json to keep one request

9
00:00:24.373 --> 00:00:27.380
展开 Rule / Expand Rule

10
00:00:27.380 --> 00:00:30.420
选择实际命中的 Guide facets / Select the matched Guide facets Rule

11
00:00:30.420 --> 00:00:33.419
取消 json，仍按规则保留一条 / Remove json while the Rule still keeps one request

12
00:00:33.419 --> 00:00:36.451
清除分组筛选但保留搜索 / Clear facet selections while keeping search

13
00:00:36.451 --> 00:00:39.418
收起筛选栏 / Hide the filter panel

14
00:00:39.418 --> 00:00:42.416
重新显示筛选栏 / Show the filter panel again

15
00:00:42.416 --> 00:00:45.485
返回示例规则 / Return to the example Rule

16
00:00:45.485 --> 00:00:48.474
停用 Guide facets / Disable Guide facets

17
00:00:48.474 --> 00:00:51.411
Apply 停用状态 / Apply the disabled state
